# THM experiments (<thm> experiment[<name>] lines): segments sharing one profiled norm and
# a background b(E) = b0 + b1 E + b2 E^2 added to the folded model (model units, E the c.m.
# energy of the entrance pair in MeV).  norm multiplies the data, as the segment norms of
# normalizations.out.  Uncertainties and covariance are those of the closed-form profile
# at fixed R-matrix parameters (inverse normal matrix of the linear least squares, not
# scaled by chi2/nu).

